# Docker resolves the ignore file for `deploy/Dockerfile` as
# `deploy/Dockerfile.dockerignore` relative to the build context (verified
# empirically 2026-09-03: a plain `deploy/.dockerignore` is NOT picked up
# when the Dockerfile lives in a subdirectory of the context). This file is
# the one Docker actually reads.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
deploy/proof/*.log
